IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.

DATA DIVISION.
   WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
   01 WS-IDX PIC 9(1).

   01 WS-TABLE.
    05 WS-REC OCCURS 2 TIMES.
        10 WS-KEY PIC X(7).
        10 WS-VALUE PIC X(7).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
   MOVE 'COBOL' TO WS-KEY(1)
   MOVE 'FIRST' TO WS-VALUE(1)

   MOVE 'PYTHON' TO WS-KEY(2)
   MOVE 'SECOND' TO WS-VALUE(2)

   DISPLAY "TABLE : "WS-TABLE.
   
   PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 2
    DISPLAY "KEY: " WS-KEY(WS-IDX)
    DISPLAY "VALUE: " WS-VALUE(WS-IDX)
   END-PERFORM.

STOP RUN.
